# NON-SECRET Compose selectors. Blank gates intentionally prevent launch.
# Future approved use: copy to .local/hindsight/compose.env, mode 0600.
# Use absolute paths and credential-free URLs. Never put tokens here.
HINDSIGHT_PRIVATE_ENV=
HINDSIGHT_DATA_VOLUME=
HINDSIGHT_LLM_PROVIDER=
HINDSIGHT_LLM_MODEL=
HINDSIGHT_LLM_BASE_URL=
HINDSIGHT_EMBEDDINGS_LOCAL_MODEL=
HINDSIGHT_RERANKER_LOCAL_MODEL=

# HINDSIGHT_PRIVATE_ENV points to a DIFFERENT mode-0600 raw env file, outside
# tracked source, provisioned through an approved secret handoff. Required:
#   HINDSIGHT_API_TENANT_API_KEY=<new dedicated service credential>
#   HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_API_KEY=<separately approved extraction credential>
# Do not include the angle-bracket placeholders literally. No quotes or shell
# expansion: Compose format: raw preserves each value, including $ and #.
# No _FILE variable is assumed; the pinned upstream reads environment values.
# Do not copy the existing Pi profile wholesale, or add per-operation provider
# overrides, remote embedding/reranker credentials, MCP tokens or integrations.
# Container environment is visible to Docker administrators; this is not a
# secret manager or a multi-user authorization boundary.
